  "description": "Allegiant's A320 N198NV for Insomniac Events, the Las Vegas festival promoter (Electric Daisy Carnival): the forward fuselage in Allegiant's white with its 'allegiant' title and sun; behind the wing a straight magenta band, edged in purple, sweeps from the crown over the wing down to the belly behind it, and aft of it the fuselage is festival art graded from orange at the top front through red and magenta to purple at the tail, with faint patterns; 'INSOMNIAC' in big white capitals on the left side, the 'edc' wordmark on the right; Allegiant's sunburst tail in orange and yellow on purple; magenta engines carrying Insomniac's white eye-and-rings mark; magenta sharklets.",
